@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g6-nouns`
IMPORT `g6-notice-and-hearing`

-- g6-tests-notice-and-hearing.l4: tests of ss.42-44.
-- Expected values were decided from the Hebrew of ss.42-44 (law.wiki lines 346-363, checked against the
-- gazette pp. 193-194) and from Interpretation Law s.10 before any run.  The dates:
--   a notice of intention delivered Wednesday 3 March 2027;
--   s.43: 30 days from it, IL s.10(a), the day of delivery not counted: day 1 is 4 March, day 30 is Friday
--     2 April 2027 (4 to 31 March are 28 days, 1 April the 29th, 2 April the 30th);
--   IL s.10(c) (applied by default to kind W): if Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April are days of rest, the last
--     day moves to Sunday 4 April 2027, which is 32 days after delivery.
-- The calendar of rest days is an input; the one below is illustrative and names only the two days that matter.

§ `Tests of ss 42 to 44`

§§ `Fixtures`

`no day of rest at all` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS EMPTY
`Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST (YMD 2027 4 2), (YMD 2027 4 3)

`the day the notice of intention is delivered` MEANS YMD 2027 3 3

-- Positional fields of `Notice of intention`:
--   delivered on, in writing, states act+date, states amount, period stated (days), states right (s 43),
--   states deemed demand, states power to add, states intention to publish name
`a complete notice of intention`                   MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE, JUST 30, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a notice that is not in writing`                  MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE, JUST 30, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a notice that omits the act and its date`         MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE, JUST 30, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a notice that omits the amount`                   MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, JUST 30, TRUE, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a notice that omits the period for payment`       MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE, NOTHING, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a notice that omits the right to make representations` MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST 30, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a notice that omits the notice treated as a demand` MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST 30, TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`a notice that omits the power to add`             MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE, JUST 30, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`a complete notice that also announces publication of the name` MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST 30, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE

`no extension granted` MEANS NOTHING
`an extension to 10 May 2027 with reasons recorded`    MEANS JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 5 10, TRUE)
`an extension to 10 May 2027 without reasons recorded` MEANS JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 5 10, FALSE)

§§ `s 42(b): the notice of intention states what the Law requires (the contents are the Law's minimum)`

#ASSERT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a complete notice of intention`
#ASSERT NOT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a notice that is not in writing`
#ASSERT NOT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a notice that omits the act and its date`
#ASSERT NOT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a notice that omits the amount`
#ASSERT NOT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a notice that omits the period for payment`
#ASSERT NOT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a notice that omits the right to make representations`
#ASSERT NOT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a notice that omits the notice treated as a demand`
#ASSERT NOT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a notice that omits the power to add`
-- "among other things": stating more than (b) requires is still a complete notice.
#ASSERT `s 42(b) — the notice of intention states what the Law requires` `a complete notice that also announces publication of the name`

§§ `s 42(a): the duty to give a notice (a MUST, no time limit, guarded by the contents)`

-- Grounds, intention and Chapter 6 in force: the duty is met by a complete notice.
#TRACE `s 42(a) — the Commissioner must give notice of intention` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `give the violator written notice of intention to impose a financial sanction` `the Commissioner` `a complete notice of intention` AT 20
-- An incomplete notice does not meet it: the duty stands (no deadline, so nothing expires).
#TRACE `s 42(a) — the Commissioner must give notice of intention` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `give the violator written notice of intention to impose a financial sanction` `the Commissioner` `a notice that omits the amount` AT 20
-- No intention to impose, no reasonable grounds, or Chapter 6 not in force: no duty.
#TRACE `s 42(a) — the Commissioner must give notice of intention` TRUE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 50)
#TRACE `s 42(a) — the Commissioner must give notice of intention` FALSE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 50)
#TRACE `s 42(a) — the Commissioner must give notice of intention` TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 50)

§§ `s 43: 30 days from delivery, IL s.10(a), and IL s.10(c) applied (kind W)`

#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day of the 30 days from the delivery of the notice` `the day the notice of intention is delivered` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day of the 30 days from the delivery of the notice` `the day the notice of intention is delivered` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 4
-- The alternative (no s.10(c)) ignores the calendar.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day of the 30 days from the delivery of the notice, without s 10(c)` `the day the notice of intention is delivered` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2

-- With the extension the Commissioner may grant "for special reasons that shall be recorded".
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 4
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 5 10
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 without reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 without reasons recorded` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 4
-- The alternative that counts an extension without recorded reasons.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, without s 10(c) and counting an extension whether or not reasons were recorded` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 without reasons recorded` EQUALS YMD 2027 5 10

-- The days allowed (the WITHIN): 30 without a rest day in the way, 32 when 2 and 3 April are days of rest.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the number of days from the day of delivery to the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `s 43 — the number of days from the day of delivery to the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS 32

-- Both edges of the window (fork F-ACTDAY).  IL s.10(a) leaves the day of delivery out of the COUNT that fixes the last day;
-- representations made ON the day of delivery are "within 30 days from" it, so that day is timely, and so is the next;
-- a day before the notice was delivered is not; the last day is inside.
#ASSERT NOT `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 3 2) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT     `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 3 3) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT     `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 3 4) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT     `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 4 2) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT NOT `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 4 3) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
-- The strict reading, callable: the period starts the day AFTER delivery, so the day of delivery is not inside it.
#ASSERT NOT `s 43 — counting the day after delivery as the first day, the day` (YMD 2027 3 3) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT     `s 43 — counting the day after delivery as the first day, the day` (YMD 2027 3 4) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT     `s 43 — counting the day after delivery as the first day, the day` (YMD 2027 4 2) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT NOT `s 43 — counting the day after delivery as the first day, the day` (YMD 2027 4 3) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all`
-- With 2 and 3 April as days of rest: 2 April, 3 April and 4 April are inside; 5 April is not.
#ASSERT     `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 4 3) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest`
#ASSERT     `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 4 4) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest`
#ASSERT NOT `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 4 5) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest`

-- The right is a MAY: exercised on day 32, or left unexercised (either way nothing is breached).
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the violator` DOES `make written representations to the Commissioner` `the violator` AT 32
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 33)
-- A notice that omits what s.42(b) requires gives the violator no s.43 right in this encoding (fork F-NOTICE).
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations` `a notice that omits the amount` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 5)

-- The Commissioner's power to extend needs special reasons, and the reasons must be recorded.
#TRACE `s 43 — the Commissioner may extend the period for representations` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `extend the period for representations` `the Commissioner` (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 5 10, TRUE) AT 3
#TRACE `s 43 — the Commissioner may extend the period for representations` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 3)

§§ `s 44(d): a notice treated as a payment demand "at the end of that period" (kind C)`

-- The deemed demand is delivered on the last day of the s.43 period: 4 April 2027 with 2 and 3 April as rest days.
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 4
-- An extension moves "that period", and so the end of it.
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 5 10
-- The alternative reading, from the day after the period ends.
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered, counting from the day after the period ends` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 3
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered, counting from the day after the period ends` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 5
-- Whether the notice is treated as a demand: only when no representations were made.
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(d) — the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand` TRUE

`a complete payment demand delivered on 1 June 2027` MEANS `Payment demand` OF YMD 2027 6 1, TRUE, TRUE, JUST 30, TRUE

-- The day the demand counts as delivered, whichever path the violator took.
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 4 2)
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` FALSE (JUST `a complete payment demand delivered on 1 June 2027`) `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 4 2)
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` TRUE (JUST `a complete payment demand delivered on 1 June 2027`) `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` TRUE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 44(b) and (c): the payment demand and the notice of no sanction, and what each states`

-- Positional fields of `Payment demand`: delivered on, in writing, states updated amount, period (days), states reasons.
`a payment demand that is not in writing`              MEANS `Payment demand` OF YMD 2027 6 1, FALSE, TRUE,  JUST 30, TRUE
`a payment demand that omits the updated amount`       MEANS `Payment demand` OF YMD 2027 6 1, TRUE,  FALSE, JUST 30, TRUE
`a payment demand that omits the period for payment`   MEANS `Payment demand` OF YMD 2027 6 1, TRUE,  TRUE,  NOTHING, TRUE
`a payment demand that omits the reasons`              MEANS `Payment demand` OF YMD 2027 6 1, TRUE,  TRUE,  JUST 30, FALSE

#ASSERT `s 44(b)(1) and (c) — the payment demand states what the Law requires` `a complete payment demand delivered on 1 June 2027`
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(b)(1) and (c) — the payment demand states what the Law requires` `a payment demand that is not in writing`
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(b)(1) and (c) — the payment demand states what the Law requires` `a payment demand that omits the updated amount`
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(b)(1) and (c) — the payment demand states what the Law requires` `a payment demand that omits the period for payment`
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(b)(1) and (c) — the payment demand states what the Law requires` `a payment demand that omits the reasons`

-- Positional fields of `Notice of a decision not to impose a sanction`: delivered on, in writing, states reasons.
`a written notice of no sanction with reasons`    MEANS `Notice of a decision not to impose a sanction` OF YMD 2027 6 1, TRUE,  TRUE
`a notice of no sanction that is not in writing`  MEANS `Notice of a decision not to impose a sanction` OF YMD 2027 6 1, FALSE, TRUE
`a written notice of no sanction without reasons` MEANS `Notice of a decision not to impose a sanction` OF YMD 2027 6 1, TRUE,  FALSE

#ASSERT `s 44(b)(2) and (c) — the notice of no sanction states what the Law requires` `a written notice of no sanction with reasons`
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(b)(2) and (c) — the notice of no sanction states what the Law requires` `a notice of no sanction that is not in writing`
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(b)(2) and (c) — the notice of no sanction states what the Law requires` `a written notice of no sanction without reasons`

§§ `s 44(a), (b): representations made, the Commissioner decides, then must give a demand or a notice`

-- Representations were made and the Commissioner decided to impose: a complete demand discharges the duty.
#TRACE `s 44(a) — the Commissioner decides after representations` TRUE `to impose the financial sanction` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `decide whether to impose a financial sanction` `the Commissioner` `to impose the financial sanction` AT 10
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `give the violator a payment demand` `the Commissioner` `a complete payment demand delivered on 1 June 2027` AT 12
-- ... and the demand must state the reasons: one without them leaves the duty standing.
#TRACE `s 44(a) — the Commissioner decides after representations` TRUE `to impose the financial sanction` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `decide whether to impose a financial sanction` `the Commissioner` `to impose the financial sanction` AT 10
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `give the violator a payment demand` `the Commissioner` `a payment demand that omits the reasons` AT 12
-- Decided not to impose: a written notice with reasons discharges the duty.
#TRACE `s 44(a) — the Commissioner decides after representations` TRUE `not to impose a financial sanction` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `decide whether to impose a financial sanction` `the Commissioner` `not to impose a financial sanction` AT 10
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `give the violator written notice that no financial sanction is imposed` `the Commissioner` `a written notice of no sanction with reasons` AT 12
-- No representations: nothing to decide.
#TRACE `s 44(a) — the Commissioner decides after representations` FALSE `to impose the financial sanction` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 40)

§§ `Forks F-X, F-C and F-DEEMED: an extension that ends on a day of rest, and the "said date"`

`Saturday 10 April 2027 as a day of rest` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST (YMD 2027 4 10)
`an extension to Saturday 10 April 2027 with reasons recorded` MEANS JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 4 10, TRUE)

-- The extension is an official's chosen day and is taken as it is (the reading taken), even on a day of rest ...
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to Saturday 10 April 2027 with reasons recorded` `Saturday 10 April 2027 as a day of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 10
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to Saturday 10 April 2027 with reasons recorded` `Saturday 10 April 2027 as a day of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 10
-- ... where the alternative moves it past the day of rest, to Sunday 11 April 2027.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, with s 10(c) applied to an extension as well` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to Saturday 10 April 2027 with reasons recorded` `Saturday 10 April 2027 as a day of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 11
-- Where there is no extension and the end is not a day of rest the two agree.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, with s 10(c) applied to an extension as well` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, with s 10(c) applied to an extension as well` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 4
-- The third reading of "the said date": the day the notice was delivered.
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered, the said date being the day the notice was delivered` `a complete notice of intention` EQUALS YMD 2027 3 3

-- Fork F-NOTICE: the alternative gives the right whatever the notice states.
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations, whatever the notice states` `a notice that omits the amount` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the violator` DOES `make written representations to the Commissioner` `the violator` AT 30
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations, whatever the notice states` `a notice that omits the amount` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 5)

§§ `s 43 and s 44(d): did the violator make his representations within the period?`

-- No representations at all: none within the period, so s.44(d) applies.
#ASSERT NOT `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` NOTHING
-- On the day of delivery: within (fork F-ACTDAY), so s.44(d) does not apply to a violator who argued that day.
#ASSERT     `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 3))
-- The day before the notice was delivered is not within.
#ASSERT NOT `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 2))
-- The strict reading, callable: representations on the day of delivery are late.
#ASSERT NOT `s 43, s 44(d) — counting the day after delivery as the first day, the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 3))
#ASSERT     `s 43, s 44(d) — counting the day after delivery as the first day, the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 4))
-- What follows for the day the demand counts as delivered: a violator who argued on the day of delivery has no deemed
-- demand (NOTHING); on the strict reading he would have one, on 2 April 2027.
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` (`s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 3))) NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` (`s 43, s 44(d) — counting the day after delivery as the first day, the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 3))) NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 4 2)
-- The day after delivery, and the last day (2 April 2027): within.
#ASSERT     `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 4))
#ASSERT     `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 4 2))
-- The day after the last day: too late, and s.44(d) applies.
#ASSERT NOT `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 4 3))
-- With 2 and 3 April days of rest, 3 and 4 April are within and 5 April is not.
#ASSERT     `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` (JUST (YMD 2027 4 4))
#ASSERT NOT `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` (JUST (YMD 2027 4 5))
-- With an extension to 10 May 2027 (reasons recorded): 5 May is within.
#ASSERT     `s 43, s 44(d) — the violator made his representations within the period` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` (JUST (YMD 2027 5 5))

§§ `Fork F-SHORTEN: an "extension" that ends before the 30 days are out does not shorten them (s.43)`

-- s.43 lets the Commissioner EXTEND the period.  A day he chooses that falls before the end of the 30 days is not an
-- extension, and the 30 days stand: the end is the later of his day and the standard end.
`an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded`    MEANS JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 3 20, TRUE)
`an extension to 20 March 2027 without reasons recorded` MEANS JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 3 20, FALSE)
`an extension to 2 April 2027 with reasons recorded`     MEANS JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 4 2, TRUE)
`an extension to Saturday 3 April 2027 with reasons recorded` MEANS JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` OF YMD 2027 4 3, TRUE)

#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 without reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
-- An extension that ends the same day as the 30 days is the same period.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 2 April 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
-- With 2 and 3 April days of rest the 30 days end on Sunday 4 April, so an extension to Saturday 3 April is earlier than them.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to Saturday 3 April 2027 with reasons recorded` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 4
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `Friday 2 and Saturday 3 April 2027 as days of rest` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 4
-- A later extension is still the end (unchanged).
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 5 10
-- The days allowed, the deemed demand's day, and the window all follow the 30 days that stand.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the number of days from the day of delivery to the last day for representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `s 44(d) — the day the notice of intention is treated as a payment demand delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 3 25) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 4 2) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all`
#ASSERT NOT `s 43 — the day` (YMD 2027 4 3) `is within the period for representations of` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all`
-- The alternative, callable: an extension is the end whatever day it is, even before the 30 days are out.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, an extension that ends before the 30 days being taken as it is` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 3 20
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, an extension that ends before the 30 days being taken as it is` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 without reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, an extension that ends before the 30 days being taken as it is` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, an extension that ends before the 30 days being taken as it is` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 10 May 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2027 5 10
-- Fork F-EXT's alternative (reasons or not, and without s.10(c)) does not shorten the 30 days either.
#ASSERT `s 43 — the last day for representations, without s 10(c) and counting an extension whether or not reasons were recorded` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 without reasons recorded` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 2
-- The right lasts the 30 days: the act at the thirtieth day is permitted.
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations` `a complete notice of intention` `an extension to 20 March 2027 with reasons recorded` `no day of rest at all` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the violator` DOES `make written representations to the Commissioner` `the violator` AT 30

§§ `Fork F-NOTICE read through to s.44(d): a notice that omits what s.42(b) requires is not deemed a payment demand`

-- The reading taken: such a notice is not "a notice under s.42" (s.43 gives the violator no right, section above), so
-- there is nothing for s.44(d) to treat as a payment demand: NOTHING, not a deemed day.  The other reading is callable.
`a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` MEANS `Notice of intention` OF YMD 2027 3 3, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST 30, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE

#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a notice that omits the right to make representations` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a notice that omits the notice treated as a demand` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a notice that omits the amount` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a notice that is not in writing` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS NOTHING
-- A complete notice is deemed a demand as before.
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 4 2)
-- A violator who did make representations is unaffected: the demand's own day once there is one.
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered` `a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` `no extension granted` TRUE (JUST `a complete payment demand delivered on 1 June 2027`) `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 6 1)
-- Whether a notice is treated as a demand, given the notice.
#ASSERT     `s 44(d) — the notice` `a complete notice of intention` `is treated as a payment demand, given` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(d) — the notice` `a complete notice of intention` `is treated as a payment demand, given` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 44(d) — the notice` `a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` `is treated as a payment demand, given` FALSE
-- The other reading, callable: whatever the notice states it is treated as a demand when no representations were made.
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered, whatever the notice states` `a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 4 2)
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered, whatever the notice states` `a complete notice of intention` `no extension granted` FALSE NOTHING `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 4 2)
#ASSERT `s 44 — the day the payment demand is delivered or treated as delivered, whatever the notice states` `a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` `no extension granted` TRUE (JUST `a complete payment demand delivered on 1 June 2027`) `no day of rest at all` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 6 1)
-- The two readings of the fork together: s.43 gives no right to such a notice (FULFILLED) ...
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations` `a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 5)
-- ... and the alternative gives it, with the deemed demand, under the other reading.
#TRACE `s 43 — the violator may make written representations, whatever the notice states` `a notice silent on the right to argue and its consequence` `no extension granted` `no day of rest at all` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the violator` DOES `make written representations to the Commissioner` `the violator` AT 3
